  "title": "Easy Pavlova",
  "description": "This pavlova has a crisp meringue exterior and soft, fluffy center; top with mounds of whipped cream and fresh fruit for a showstopping dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Rosina"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-04-05T19:50:13-04:00",
