  "ingredients": [
    "4 large egg whites",
    "1.25 cups white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons cornstarch",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 teaspoon lemon juice",
    "1 pint heavy cream",
    "6 kiwi, peeled and sliced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper; draw a 9-inch circle on the parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jSgvshjsD8qsbDH33tT8tgtxLsU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12126-EasyPavlova-ddmfs-step1-4x3.5024-8be226da4a60438c8d4a9581c325969c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12126/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites in a glass, metal, or ceramic bowl until stiff but not dry. Gradually add sugar, about 1 tablespoon at a time, beating well after each addition. Continue beating until meringue is thick, white, and glossy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fkf0PYQImtIUVHXw-WBpJ9GrQc0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12126-EasyPavlova-ddmfs-step2-4x3.5033-26c474a75e4c41c59bf321d7bb5f4990.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12126/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold in cornstarch, vanilla extract, and lemon juice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon mixture inside the circle drawn on the parchment paper. Working from the center, spread mixture toward the outside edge and build the edge slightly. This should leave a slight depression in the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RYGAcmxdfW4IHbdluSoQdf_AnfM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12126-EasyPavlova-ddmfs-step3-4x3.5044-af88f4fead024f0c8da38e7a6e62e43d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12126/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until meringue is dry and sounds hollow when tapped, about 1 hour. Cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CVplSQwzz1nvbFN-d2tGGRuu8S4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12126-EasyPavlova-ddmfs-step4-4x35110-01929ae026db4499a370f9651191b2a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12126/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat heavy cream in a medium bowl until stiff peaks form; set aside. Remove meringue from the parchment paper and place on a flat serving plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill center of meringue with whipped cream and top with kiwi slices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7c9Y9DtOMCGQ8yOZKDSB5-zJyno=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12126-EasyPavlova-ddmfs-step5-4x35118-cd3180c4453f47e1991cc7e1d980fa6c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12126/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with fruit and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zmBl2kLGSe8Gr3mltOw3vwW5IAw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12126-easy-pavlova-DDMFS-4x3-a751c2b63d2a4393ac2dab4c608a12d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12126/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
